      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The granitescale is about to take piercing or slashing damage</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The granitescale twists to take the blow on their hardest scales, which they shed to reduce the incoming force. The granitescale gains resistance 15 to the damage, but their AC is reduced by 2 for 1 day, when the shed scales regrow.</p>",
